<task id="042" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Implement H0.5 Consent-Capture Handler + BFF POST /api/onboarding/consent-callback Endpoint</title>
    <phase>C Wave C4 — Handler Implementations</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Task tags include 'bff-api','auth' (BFF endpoint); modifies .cs files in Sprk.Bff.Api; auth-sensitive (HMAC verification + Anonymous endpoint); crosses BFF/L2 boundary.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Two-surface task (BFF endpoint + L2 handler) with complete spec (FR-02, §4.1 H0.5 row, D18); ADR-013 facade compliance concrete; not a cross-cutting refactor. Effort xhigh because it touches BFF + L2 + HMAC crypto boundary + must coordinate with Wave C6 ArchTests.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Touches src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/** (BFF surface); must run under §10 BFF Hygiene checklist and coordinate with Wave C6 ArchTests for §4D I1/I5 compliance. /conflict-check required before PR per r3 handoff §7 (19 active BFF worktrees).</parallel-reason>
    <deps>036</deps>
    <tags>l2-controlplane, job-handler, bff-api, auth, api</tags>
